-- ===========================================================================
-- Warlock / Demonology: Metamorphosis talent description follow-up
-- ===========================================================================
--
-- woa_2026_08_02_07.sql reworked Metamorphosis (47241) into a shard-fuelled
-- stance and rewrote that spell's own SpellDescription0 and SpellToolTip0 to
-- match.  It missed 59672 -- the spell Talent.dbc row 1886 rank 1 points at,
-- and therefore the text the talent pane actually renders.  59672 still
-- advertised the +600% armor (moved to Demonic Aegis in woa_2026_08_02_03.sql),
-- the melee crit avoidance, and a "3 minute cooldown" that RecoveryTime = 0
-- deleted.
--
-- New text mirrors 47241's description and reuses $47241s3 rather than a
-- literal 20% so a future retune of EffectBasePoints3 carries through.
--
-- NOT MENTIONED, deliberately: the stun/snare duration reduction.  That still
-- applies -- AuraEffect::HandleShapeshiftBoosts casts 54817 and 54879 for
-- FORM_METAMORPHOSIS (SpellAuraEffects.cpp:1398) regardless of what 47241's
-- own effects say -- but 47241's description already omits it, so the two
-- descriptions are kept consistent.  See the note in the summary about 54879.
--
-- 59673 carries the same stale armor/cooldown text but has Attributes
-- 8388992 (0x800180), which includes SPELL_ATTR0_DO_NOT_DISPLAY (0x80), so it
-- is never
-- shown; left alone rather than adding a 234-column row for hidden text.
--
-- ===========================================================================


